From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] d3drm: frame texture topology and materials, texture and load-from-resource (3594)

d3drm: frame texture topology and materials, texture and load-from-resource

IDirect3DRMFrame/2 Get/SetTextureTopology, IDirect3DRMFrame3 Get/SetMaterial and
Get/SetMaterialOverride keep their state; IDirect3DRMTexture/2/3 InitFromResource
and InitFromResource2 read bitmap resources (bare DIB or whole bitmap file);
IDirect3DRM/2/3::LoadTextureFromResource create the texture through them.
---
diff --git a/dlls/d3drm/d3drm.c b/dlls/d3drm/d3drm.c
index e9eaecc..fa8161d 100644
